WEBVTT

00:07.862 --> 00:09.137
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.206 --> 00:10.827
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.310
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.379 --> 00:14.275
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.344 --> 00:17.310
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.379 --> 00:19.413
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.482 --> 00:21.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.482 --> 00:23.310
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.379 --> 00:25.000
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.068 --> 00:27.344
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.413 --> 00:29.137
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.206 --> 00:31.379
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.413
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.482 --> 00:35.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.344 --> 00:37.413
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.482 --> 00:39.517
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.586 --> 00:40.862
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.931 --> 00:42.724
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.793 --> 00:45.448
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.517 --> 00:47.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.793 --> 00:49.517
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.586 --> 00:53.448
[groovy music]
[动听的音乐]

00:53.517 --> 01:00.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.862 --> 01:05.103
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

01:06.965 --> 01:08.724
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:08.793 --> 01:10.137
[bell dings]
[铃声]

01:10.206 --> 01:13.931
- Squidward, order up!
-SpongeBob!
- 章鱼哥，下令！
-海绵宝宝！

01:14.000 --> 01:16.275
Don't you know
how to keep quiet?
你不知道吗
如何保持安静？

01:16.344 --> 01:18.000
- I don't know,
but hum a few bars,
- 我不知道，
但哼几小节，

01:18.068 --> 01:19.275
and maybe I can fake it.
也许我可以假装它。

01:19.344 --> 01:20.379
[laughs]
[笑]

01:20.448 --> 01:23.310
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:23.379 --> 01:25.862
Sorry for getting angry
with you, SpongeBob.
抱歉生气了
和你在一起，海绵宝宝。

01:25.931 --> 01:30.448
I'm just very concerned
about your health, that's all.
我只是很担心
关于你的健康，仅此而已。

01:30.517 --> 01:32.620
- Oh, that's okay, Squidward.
You know, just the other day,
-哦，没关系，章鱼哥。
你知道，就在前几天，

01:32.689 --> 01:34.448
I--what, my health?
我——什么，我的健康？

01:34.517 --> 01:39.103
- Yeah, it's probably nothing.
Forget I brought it up.
- 是的，可能没什么。
忘记我提出来了。

01:39.172 --> 01:40.827
- What about
my health, Squidward?
- 怎么样
我的健康状况怎么样，章鱼哥？

01:40.896 --> 01:42.275
What do you know?
你知道什么？

01:42.344 --> 01:44.896
What's my body
been saying behind my back?
我的身体是什么
背后说我？

01:44.965 --> 01:46.206
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:46.275 --> 01:49.172
Well, if you really
want to know,
好吧，如果你真的
想知道，

01:49.241 --> 01:52.241
it's the gap between
your teeth.
这是之间的差距
你的牙齿。

01:52.310 --> 01:54.862
- My gap?
I have a gap?
- 我的差距？
我有差距？

01:54.931 --> 01:57.896
What's wrong with my gap?
Gap!
我的差距怎么了？
差距！

01:57.965 --> 01:59.275
- [shudders]
- [颤抖]

01:59.344 --> 02:01.896
- A gap that big
between your teeth
- 差距那么大
你的牙齿之间

02:01.965 --> 02:04.034
can be extremely dangerous.
可能非常危险。

02:04.103 --> 02:05.793
You can get something
caught in it.
你可以获得一些东西
陷入其中。

02:05.862 --> 02:07.482
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:07.551 --> 02:11.103
- It obstructs your airway,
and now, you can't breathe.
- 它会阻塞你的呼吸道，
现在，你无法呼吸。

02:11.172 --> 02:12.517
- [wheezing]
- [喘息]

02:12.586 --> 02:15.172
I can't breathe,
I can't breathe!
我无法呼吸，
我无法呼吸！

02:15.241 --> 02:17.275
Call a doctor!
打电话叫医生！

02:17.344 --> 02:19.931
- No need to
call a doctor, SpongeBob.
- 不需要
打电话给医生，海绵宝宝。

02:20.000 --> 02:21.137
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:21.206 --> 02:24.793
- I will be your dentist.
- 我将成为你的牙医。

02:24.862 --> 02:26.931
- You will?
- 你会？

02:27.000 --> 02:28.862
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:28.931 --> 02:30.896
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

02:30.965 --> 02:34.862
Guess I got to use good
old-fashioned tentacle grease.
我想我得用好
老式触手油脂。

02:34.931 --> 02:37.965
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:38.034 --> 02:39.689
- Ow!
- 噢！

02:41.862 --> 02:44.137
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:44.206 --> 02:46.172
[drill whirrs]
[钻头呼呼地响]

02:46.241 --> 02:48.896
- All better.
That should seal up
- 一切都好起来了。
那应该封起来

02:48.965 --> 02:51.034
that drafty gap.
- Ah!
那个通风的间隙。
- 啊！

02:51.103 --> 02:53.034
- And kill the whistling.
- 并消除口哨声。

02:53.103 --> 02:54.620
[laughs]
[笑]

02:54.689 --> 02:56.206
[deep voice]
- Well, thank you,
[低沉的声音]
- 嗯，谢谢你，

02:56.275 --> 02:58.206
Dr. Squidward!
章鱼哥博士！

02:58.275 --> 03:01.793
Say, without a gap,
my voice sounds almost...
说，没有间隙，
我的声音听起来几乎...

03:01.862 --> 03:03.689
cool.
凉爽的。

03:03.758 --> 03:06.620
Testing, testing,
one, two, three.
测试，测试，
一、二、三。

03:06.689 --> 03:09.310
You know, with this voice,
I don't need whistling.
你知道，用这个声音，
我不需要吹口哨。

03:09.379 --> 03:11.655
Oh, I've got to sing!
哦，我一定要唱歌！

03:11.724 --> 03:14.103
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

03:14.172 --> 03:17.103
[jazz scatting]
[爵士乐散播]

03:17.172 --> 03:19.689
Flip, flip, flip, flap!
翻转，翻转，翻转，翻转！

03:19.758 --> 03:21.689
[jazz scatting]
[爵士乐散播]

03:21.758 --> 03:28.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:31.137 --> 03:35.241
- Oh, where is that
heavenly voice coming from?
- 哦，那是哪里
天籁之音从何而来？

03:36.862 --> 03:38.068
I must--huh?
我必须——嗯？

03:38.137 --> 03:40.241
- [jazz scatting]
- [爵士乐散播]

03:40.310 --> 03:42.241
- Oh, blowfish!
- 哦，河豚！

03:42.310 --> 03:45.448
Does he have to
ruin everything for me?
他必须吗
毁了我的一切？

03:45.517 --> 03:46.793
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:46.862 --> 03:51.793
- What a dreamy voice!
- Wow, it really swings.
- 多么梦幻的声音啊！
- 哇，真的很摇摆。

03:51.862 --> 03:53.586
[clamoring]
[叫喊]

03:53.655 --> 03:55.000
- [jazz scatting]
- [爵士乐散播]

03:55.068 --> 03:59.448
- Hey, everybody, look.
SpongeBob is cool now!
- 嘿，大家看。
海绵宝宝现在很酷！

03:59.517 --> 04:00.689
- [purrs]
- [呼噜声]

04:00.758 --> 04:03.586
- Hmm, maybe I can
use SpongeBob
- 嗯，也许我可以
使用海绵宝宝

04:03.655 --> 04:07.068
to get in with all those cool
people at the jazz club.
和那些很酷的人在一起
爵士乐俱乐部的人。

04:07.137 --> 04:08.068
Yeah!
是的！

04:08.137 --> 04:09.517
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:09.586 --> 04:12.275
- [purrs]
- [呼噜声]

04:12.344 --> 04:14.517
Yeah.
- Hey, SpongeBob.
是的。
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

04:14.586 --> 04:17.034
Owie, owie, owie, owie!
Um, how would you
哎哟，哎哟，哎哟，哎哟！
嗯，你会怎样

04:17.103 --> 04:21.310
like to accompany me to my
favorite jazz club tonight?
喜欢陪我到我的
今晚最喜欢的爵士俱乐部？

04:21.379 --> 04:25.793
- Oh, boy, would I?
That sounds so cool.
- 哦，孩子，我会吗？
听起来很酷。

04:25.862 --> 04:28.379
all: Aw!
全体：噢！

04:28.448 --> 04:31.379
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

04:31.448 --> 04:37.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:37.103 --> 04:39.482
[snapping]
[啪啪啪]

04:39.551 --> 04:43.413
- Oh, man, that beat
is so pure, it hurts.
- 哦，伙计，那节拍
是那么的纯粹，让人心痛。

04:43.482 --> 04:48.241
- Ah, my people!
Hey, hipsters.
- 啊，我的人民！
嘿，潮人。

04:48.310 --> 04:51.310
It's groovy, cats.
I can dig it.
太棒了，猫们。
我可以挖它。

04:51.379 --> 04:52.931
all: Lame.
全体：蹩脚。

04:53.000 --> 04:57.448
- Hm, turn away from me, huh?
We'll just see.
- 嗯，转身离开我，嗯？
我们拭目以待吧。

04:57.517 --> 05:00.758
Oh, it's past 8:00.
Where is SpongeBob?
哦，已经八点多了。
海绵宝宝在哪里？

05:00.827 --> 05:03.758
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

05:03.827 --> 05:06.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:06.448 --> 05:08.724
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

05:08.793 --> 05:13.724
- Hey, cool crowd.
What's shaking?
- 嘿，很酷的人群。
什么在晃动？

05:13.793 --> 05:16.310
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

05:16.379 --> 05:19.448
Hey, hipsters.
It's groovy, cats.
嘿，潮人。
太棒了，猫们。

05:19.517 --> 05:20.724
Oh, I can dig it.
哦，我可以挖它。

05:20.793 --> 05:22.896
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

05:22.965 --> 05:24.137
[shoes squeak]
[鞋子吱吱作响]

05:24.206 --> 05:26.241
- Oh, welcome, man.
- 哦，欢迎，伙计。

05:26.310 --> 05:29.241
You're the coolest
customer we've ever had.
你是最酷的
我们曾经有过的客户。

05:29.310 --> 05:33.448
- Oh, crazy, Daddy.
Crazy.
- 哦，太疯狂了，爸爸。
疯狂的。

05:33.517 --> 05:36.758
- Can I seat you
at the coolest table?
- 我可以给你安排座位吗
在最酷的桌子上？

05:36.827 --> 05:39.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:39.586 --> 05:41.827
- No, thank you.
I'm here to meet up
- 不，谢谢。
我是来见面的

05:41.896 --> 05:43.275
with a real cool cat.
和一只真正酷的猫。

05:43.344 --> 05:45.724
Oh, there he is.
Hey Squideroonie!
哦，他在那儿。
嘿，史奎德鲁尼！

05:45.793 --> 05:46.827
- Ah!
- 啊！

05:46.896 --> 05:50.482
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:50.551 --> 05:51.896
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

05:51.965 --> 05:53.931
- You're with him?
- 你和他在一起吗？

05:54.000 --> 05:55.655
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

05:55.724 --> 05:59.793
Yes, you're with me.
And he is my--
是的，你和我在一起。
而他是我的——

05:59.862 --> 06:03.517
best...friend...
最好的……朋友……

06:03.586 --> 06:06.448
- You heard the man, folks.
He's by best friend.
- 你们听到了这个人的话，伙计们。
他是最好的朋友的。

06:06.517 --> 06:08.620
Can you dig it?
- Huh?
你能挖到吗？
- 啊？

06:08.689 --> 06:10.827
Huh.
呵呵。

06:10.896 --> 06:13.655
- I guess he's...
- 我猜他是...

06:13.724 --> 06:15.620
cool?
凉爽的？

06:15.689 --> 06:20.620
- I don't know, man.
Something smells lame.
- 我不知道，伙计。
有些东西闻起来很蹩脚。

06:20.689 --> 06:24.413
- Hey, CoolBob,
why don't you sing
- 嘿，酷鲍勃，
你为什么不唱歌

06:24.482 --> 06:27.655
everybody one of your
singing cool tunes?
每个人都是你的一员
唱酷曲？

06:27.724 --> 06:31.068
- Oh, no, Daddio.
I really couldn't.
- 哦，不，爸爸。
我实在做不到。

06:31.137 --> 06:33.724
[snapping]
[啪啪啪]

06:33.793 --> 06:35.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:35.517 --> 06:38.172
- Well, okay,
maybe just one ditty.
- 嗯，好吧，
也许只是一首小曲。

06:38.241 --> 06:39.862
Then I'll get out your hair.
那我就把你的头发拔掉。

06:39.931 --> 06:43.793
- And I will accompany you
on my licorice stick.
- 我会陪你
在我的甘草棒上。

06:43.862 --> 06:46.517
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:46.586 --> 06:48.758
Just as I planned.
正如我计划的那样。

06:48.827 --> 06:50.000
[laughs]
[笑]

06:50.068 --> 06:52.206
[off-key clarinet]
[走调单簧管]

06:52.275 --> 06:54.310
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:54.379 --> 06:56.241
[boos]
[嘘声]

06:56.310 --> 06:58.931
- Would you care
for a mute, sir?
- 你会在意吗
先生，要哑巴吗？

06:59.000 --> 07:02.586
All the great jazz
musicians use mutes.
所有伟大的爵士乐
音乐家使用静音器。

07:02.655 --> 07:07.551
- Hey, that's right, they do.
Thanks, Daddio.
- 嘿，没错，他们就是这么做的。
谢谢，爸爸。

07:07.620 --> 07:10.448
- A-one, a-two,
a bop-bubbly boo.
- A-一，A-二，
充满泡沫的嘘声。

07:10.517 --> 07:12.482
[gargles]
[漱口]

07:12.551 --> 07:15.344
[jazz scatting]
[爵士乐散播]

07:15.413 --> 07:17.655
[clamoring]
[叫喊]

07:17.724 --> 07:20.862
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

07:20.931 --> 07:26.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:26.793 --> 07:30.413
[high-pitched jazz scatting]
[高音爵士乐散射]

07:31.862 --> 07:33.000
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:34.758 --> 07:36.586
[high-pitched vocalizing]
[高亢的声音]

07:36.655 --> 07:38.655
[low-pitched jazz scatting]
[低音调爵士乐]

07:38.724 --> 07:41.344
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

07:41.413 --> 07:42.793
[snapping]
[啪啪啪]

07:42.862 --> 07:47.206
- At last, I'm cool!
Mwah!
- 最后，我很酷！
哇！

07:47.275 --> 07:48.965
[laughs]
[笑]

07:50.896 --> 07:53.103
[laughs]
[笑]

07:53.172 --> 07:54.655
Go on, go on--
继续，继续——

07:54.724 --> 07:58.413
- That was so cool,
it caused structural damage!
- 太酷了，
它造成了结构性损坏！

07:58.482 --> 08:00.655
You got to play
some more for us cats.
你必须玩
还有一些给我们猫的。

08:00.724 --> 08:02.034
Don't leave us hanging.
别让我们悬着。

08:02.103 --> 08:03.827
[high voice]
- Oh, aren't you nice, I--
[高声]
- 哦，你不是很好吗，我--

08:03.896 --> 08:07.551
- Uh, sorry, man.
We're going to bounce, you dig?
- 呃，对不起，伙计。
我们会弹跳，你明白吗？

08:07.620 --> 08:11.241
Hey, we got to go spread
some more joy, baby.
嘿，我们得去散布
多一些快乐，宝贝。

08:11.310 --> 08:15.758
But we'll be back tomorrow
night to blow the roof back on.
但我们明天就会回来
晚上把屋顶吹回去。

08:15.827 --> 08:18.206
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

08:18.275 --> 08:20.206
- Yay--
- 耶 -

08:20.275 --> 08:23.034
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

08:23.103 --> 08:26.137
- Thanks, Dr. Squidward.
That was so much fun
- 谢谢，章鱼哥博士。
太有趣了

08:26.206 --> 08:28.000
being "cool" for one night.
“酷”一晚。

08:28.068 --> 08:32.103
- We are going to stay "cool"
every night if it kills us!
- 我们要保持“冷静”
每天晚上如果它杀了我们！

08:32.172 --> 08:36.448
Got it, Daddio?
- Okay, best friend.
明白了吗，爸爸？
- 好的，最好的朋友。

08:36.517 --> 08:39.517
[laughs]
[笑]

08:39.586 --> 08:41.413
- We just
have to make sure
- 我们只是
必须确定

08:41.482 --> 08:44.206
that gap in your teeth
stays closed.
你牙齿上的那个缝隙
保持关闭状态。

08:44.275 --> 08:47.827
Say cheese.
- Chee-
说奶酪。
- 奇-

08:47.896 --> 08:49.517
[gargling]
[漱口]

08:49.586 --> 08:51.275
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:51.344 --> 08:54.275
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

08:54.344 --> 08:55.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:55.482 --> 08:57.068
You ready, Daddio?
你准备好了吗，爸爸？

08:57.137 --> 08:58.517
[deep voice]
- Baby, I was born ready.
[低沉的声音]
- 宝贝，我生来就准备好了。

08:58.586 --> 08:59.517
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

08:59.586 --> 09:01.517
[jazz scatting]
[爵士乐散播]

09:01.586 --> 09:03.551
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

09:03.620 --> 09:05.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:05.931 --> 09:10.000
- Cool.
- Real cool.
- 凉爽的。
- 真酷。

09:10.068 --> 09:12.931
- This next one goes out
to all the--
- 下一张出去了
致所有——

09:13.000 --> 09:15.724
[high voice]
ladies!
[高声]
ladies!

09:15.793 --> 09:18.000
[high-pitched jazz scatting]
[高音爵士乐散射]

09:18.068 --> 09:19.620
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:19.689 --> 09:21.275
- Take it, Squidward.
- 拿着它，章鱼哥。

09:21.344 --> 09:25.724
- I'm going to start
this solo on a high note!
- 我要开始了
这首独奏高调！

09:25.793 --> 09:27.137
[sharp inhale]
[剧烈吸气]

09:27.206 --> 09:29.482
[muffled notes]
[低沉的音符]

09:29.551 --> 09:33.344
[off-key clarinet]
[走调单簧管]

09:33.413 --> 09:35.896
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:37.655 --> 09:39.896
- I knew he smelled lame.
- 我知道他闻起来很蹩脚。

09:39.965 --> 09:42.586
- [low-pitched jazz scatting]
- [低音爵士乐散射]

09:47.000 --> 09:48.827
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

09:51.344 --> 09:53.551
[jazz scatting]
[爵士乐散播]

09:55.551 --> 09:57.000
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

09:57.068 --> 09:59.482
If I'm not allowed
to be cool anymore,
如果我不被允许
想要再酷一点

09:59.551 --> 10:02.448
then neither is SpongeBob!
那么海绵宝宝也不是！

10:02.517 --> 10:05.068
[yells]
[喊叫]

10:05.137 --> 10:07.413
[groaning]
[呻吟]

10:07.482 --> 10:09.379
Oh, uh-huh.
哦，嗯。

10:09.448 --> 10:13.103
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:13.172 --> 10:15.034
- [jazz scatting]
- [爵士乐散播]

10:17.034 --> 10:21.172
Zoop, zop, zlim, zlam, jam!
Zoop，zop，zlim，zlam，果酱！

10:21.241 --> 10:23.241
Bam!
嘭！

10:24.586 --> 10:26.241
[high voice]
- Yeah, okay.
[高声]
- 是啊，好吧。

10:26.310 --> 10:28.344
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:28.413 --> 10:31.965
Hey, my gap's back!
嘿，我的差距又回来了！

10:32.034 --> 10:34.241
[murmuring]
[淙淙]

10:34.310 --> 10:36.482
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

10:36.551 --> 10:38.793
You see?
He's not cool!
你看？
他不酷！

10:38.862 --> 10:43.137
He's square!
He's a food-flipping fraud.
他是方的！
他是个倒卖食物的骗子。

10:43.206 --> 10:44.310
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:44.379 --> 10:45.896
[whistles]
Sorry.
[口哨声]
抱歉。

10:45.965 --> 10:49.103
Did you hear that!
My whistle is back, too.
你听到了吗！
我的哨子也回来了。

10:49.172 --> 10:53.103
Who needs singing
when you can whistle?
谁需要唱歌
什么时候可以吹口哨？

10:53.172 --> 10:54.482
[whistles]
[口哨声]

10:54.551 --> 10:58.172
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

10:58.241 --> 10:59.793
all: Ooh, yeah.
全体：哦，是啊。

10:59.862 --> 11:03.310
- What--what's going on?
Why are you snapping?
- 什么--发生什么事了？
你为什么要啪啪啪？

11:03.379 --> 11:05.000
Stop snapping!
别抢了！

11:05.068 --> 11:08.620
- That's the most righteous
sound I've ever heard, man.
——这才是最正义的
我听过的声音，伙计。

11:08.689 --> 11:11.482
Follow the leader of cool!
跟随酷酷的领袖！

11:11.551 --> 11:16.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

11:16.068 --> 11:17.068
[whistles]
[口哨声]

11:17.137 --> 11:19.689
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

11:19.758 --> 11:21.344
[whistling harmony]
[口哨和谐]

11:21.413 --> 11:23.758
- Hmm, you know what?
- 嗯，你知道吗？

11:23.827 --> 11:28.034
If that is what passes
for "cool" now,
如果事情就这样过去了
现在为了“酷”，

11:28.103 --> 11:32.103
then I don't want
to be cool anymore!
那我不想
不再酷了！

11:32.172 --> 11:33.689
[grunts]
[咕哝]

11:35.586 --> 11:37.172
Huh?
啊？

11:37.241 --> 11:40.068
[groans]
[呻吟]

11:40.137 --> 11:42.413
- Oh, you're not
leaving this time
-哦，你不是
这次离开

11:42.482 --> 11:47.344
until you pay for
the damages first, Daddio.
直到你付钱为止
首先是损失，达迪奥。

11:47.413 --> 11:50.068
[whistling]
- This stinks.
[吹口哨]
- 这很臭。

11:51.034 --> 11:54.931
[groovy music]
[动听的音乐]

11:55.000 --> 12:02.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪